# Uninstalling for New Users
#Even though youТve uninstalled all the apps for all the users, every time you create a new user, the default apps will be reinstalled for that user. You can prevent this default action by executing the following command in the Powershell.

Get-AppXProvisionedPackage -online | Remove-AppxProvisionedPackage -online

